header: "---\nname: jake-x-x-plan\ndescription: \"Plan the user's week on X - what to post, when to post it, and who to engage with. Use when the user says \\\"plan my week\\\", \\\"what should I post\\\", \\\"content calendar\\\", \\\"posting schedule\\\", \\\"I have nothing to post about\\\", or wants a weekly mix of posts, threads and replies and a list of accounts to engage.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/x-agent-skill\n  upstream_skill: x-plan\n  upstream_commit: 7822c29b4aedbd400b9339839d3f59f3652b1317\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
